      "content": "Your symptoms might be slightly unusual and could be a possibility of eye strain from excessive screen time, especially if you have been staring at screens for extended periods during preparation for your presentation. However, it would be a wise idea to take breaks from the screen and monitor your symptoms for the next few hours. If they persist or worsen, consider visiting an eye specialist to rule out any serious conditions such as retinal detachment, which would require immediate attention. In the meantime, ensure you're getting adequate rest and not overexerting your visual focus.",
