      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i've been doing that for weeks so it's probably not just today. the shadow part is what's weird though. if i just take some ibuprofen or maybe some of those vitamin drops and try to sleep it off, i'll probably be fine by tomorrow morning right? i really can't afford to spend the night in a waiting room.",
